// Ashfang Raiders dialogue - spliced into default.amd's `## Dialogue` section via
// `File: dialogue/ashfang.amd`. A scene's Speaker is the clan (face/name/color);
// When: comms makes it the scene a station hail opens. Body lines are % variants;
// choices link to the next scene with optional `if <guard>` and `; <outcomes>`.

# Ashfang Hail (ashfang_hail)
---
Speaker: ashfang
When: comms
---
% You're a long way from friends, captain.
% Brave or stupid, flying in here. Hard to tell which.

- [Apologize and back off](ashfang_backoff)
- [Threaten them](ashfang_standoff) if fearsome > 20
- [Offer a cut of your cargo](ashfang_deal) if credits >= 200

# The Deal (ashfang_deal)
---
Speaker: ashfang
---
% Hah. Maybe you're smarter than you look. Leave the crates and go.

- [Hand it over](ashfang_done) ; costs 200 credits, earns ashfang selfish 5, signal ashfang_paid

# Standoff (ashfang_standoff)
---
Speaker: ashfang
---
% Bold. We respect bold... right up until we don't.

- [Hold your ground](ashfang_done) ; earns ashfang fearsome 10
- [Think better of it](ashfang_backoff) ; earns ashfang cowardly 5

# Back Off (ashfang_backoff)
---
Speaker: ashfang
---
% Smart. Run along, little ship.

# Done (ashfang_done)
---
Speaker: ashfang
---
% We're done here. For now.
